        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot awakens, finding itself in a digital wasteland ravaged by a virus. LOOPOOL is a sci-fi adventure puzzle game that combines exploration, puzzles, and storytelling to gradually unveil the secrets behind these ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Solitary and Enigmatic Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One robot, one desolate and shattered world. No clamor of human voices, only the low hum of the wind blowing through the ruins and the faint buzz from a distant past. You are the only “life” in this wasteland, bearing a mission: to piece together the truth of this world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Forgotten World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will navigate through crumbling buildings and rusted machinery, using a neural data cable to decrypt the “Data Fragments” scattered throughout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle of Survival and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with threats lurking in the shadows, you must remain ever vigilant. Yet even so, every step is an adventure, every choice a matter of life or death. Will you press forward, or choose to retreat? This wasteland watches you—it never forgives mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting Parts and Chips to Strengthen Yourself</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using the Neural Data Cable to Infiltrate Devices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible “Data Echoes”</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Labor of One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dream crafted single-handedly by an independent developer with sweat and passion. From every line of code to every design detail, it’s infused with heart and perseverance. This is more than a game—it’s a growing story—and you can be a part of it. Join our community, shape this world with me, and explore profound questions about humanity and the future: when machines rule all, are we still “us”?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot awakens, finding itself in a digital wasteland ravaged by a virus. LOOPOOL is a sci-fi adventure puzzle game that combines exploration, puzzles, and storytelling to gradually unveil the secrets behind these ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Solitary and Enigmatic Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One robot, one desolate and shattered world. No clamor of human voices, only the low hum of the wind blowing through the ruins and the faint buzz from a distant past. You are the only “life” in this wasteland, bearing a mission: to piece together the truth of this world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2442058c051309933fffa193eb2c2d0d.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Forgotten World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will navigate through crumbling buildings and rusted machinery, using a neural data cable to decrypt the “Data Fragments” scattered throughout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/2dd767b4c3fa73fc7b8be67213d2725d.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle of Survival and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with threats lurking in the shadows, you must remain ever vigilant. Yet even so, every step is an adventure, every choice a matter of life or death. Will you press forward, or choose to retreat? This wasteland watches you—it never forgives mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.poster.avif?t=1767510355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.webm?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/40b45bd991e2985a4b30f14bfc8d2c8e.mp4?t=1767510355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting Parts and Chips to Strengthen Yourself</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using the Neural Data Cable to Infiltrate Devices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible “Data Echoes”</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Labor of One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dream crafted single-handedly by an independent developer with sweat and passion. From every line of code to every design detail, it’s infused with heart and perseverance. This is more than a game—it’s a growing story—and you can be a part of it. Join our community, shape this world with me, and explore profound questions about humanity and the future: when machines rule all, are we still “us”?</p>",
